### Input Fields
Dark backgrounds (#0a0a0c) with 1px "Nebula Teal" borders. On focus, the bo=
rder transitions to "Cyan Glow" with a subtle inner light.

### Cards
Glassmorphic containers with a `blur(16px)` background. Borders are 1px sem=
